 <h3><u>rahe salamat</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><big>ya hussain <br><br>hussain maula hussain <br>sina pe bol raha hai<br>hussain ibne ali <br>lahu me apne naha kar<br>hazaar sadme utha kar<br>yazidiyat ko mita kar<br><br>khuda ke deen ka parcham baland maine kiya<br>kisi yazeed me taaqat kahaan jhukaaye mujhe<br>safar ba noke sina par pasand maine kiya<br>sune ye saara zamaana hussain ki aawaaz<br><br>ashhado an la elaha illalla<br>ashhado anna mohammad ur rasulallah<br>ashhado anna aliyun valiullah<br><br>qubul is liye neze ki nok ki maine<br>mera kata huwa sar dushmanon se past na ho<br>mein sar uthaaye huwe dushmanon se kehta hun<br>hussain hota wahi hai jise shikast na ho<br>mere azaadaaro ay mere ghamkhaaro <br>tumhaare azm ko mera salaam<br><br>maula hussain sarkaar farmaate hain<br>ye mera ishq hai jo lahu banke tumhaari ragon me daur raha hai<br>rahe salaamat ta qayaamat <br>rahe salaamat ishqe hussaini<br><span></span>range wafa dikhlaata hai<br>warna kaun kisi ki khaatir<br>apna khun bahaata hai<br><br>rahe salaamat ta qayaamat <br>rahe salamat ishqe hussaini<br><span></span>range wafa dikhlaata hai<br><br>ye kaale kapre jo zebe tan hain<br>ishqe hussaini ki hai daleel<br>jhule amaari taaziyadaari<br>sina zani paani ki sabil<br>ehle aza ko ye tehzeebe<br>ishqe hussain sikhaata hai<br><br>ye chote bachche aur shab bedaari<br>yun to bara mushkil hai safar<br>socho agar tum ahle zamana<br>ishqe hussaini ka hai asar<br>ishqe hussain hi in bachchon ko<br>farshe aza tak laata hai<br><br>dekho zara tum kaabe me jaakar<br>sirf musalmaan honge wahaan<br>farshe aza wo waahid jagah hai<br>apne paraaye sab hai jahaan<br>aata wahi hai farshe aza par<br>jisko hussain bulaata hai<br><br>wo jo bina-e farshe aza hai<br>ham hain usi bibi ki duaayen<br>ishqe hussaini tha uske dil me<br>aur ham ko virse me mila<br>jisko mila virse me ye maatam <br>ahle aza kehlaata hai<br><br>ishqe hussaini dil me basaa kar<br>zinda rakhi ghazi ne wafa<br>jis ne wafa ko zinda rakha hai<br>baali sakina ka hai chacha<br>usko dua deti hai sakina<br>jo bhi alam ko uthaata hai<br><br>ishqe hussaini se hain namazein <br>ishqe hussaini farshe aza<br>ishqe hussaini sholon pe chalne<br>sina zani zanjeer o kama<br>ishqe hussaini ki taaqat se<br>maatami khun me nahaata hai<br><br>suno mazhar o irfan<br>ay azaadaaraane man<br>yehi wo shohada-e karbala hain<br>jinhon ne halmin ki sada par labbaik kaha<br>aur mere iskq me apni jaanon ka nazraana pesh kiya<br><br>muslim bin awsaja, anas bin haaris<br>burayre hamdani, hanzala bin asad<br>abdur rahman gaffaari, saif bin haris<br>hur, habib, john, abusamama<br>umro bin ansaari, shojab bin abdullah<br>aabis bin shabib, abdullah gaffari<br>wahbe kalbi, abu shahasa<br>shabeeb bin abdullah, ammar ibne hassan<br>junada bin kaab, junada bin haris<br>saeed ibne haaris, zohair ibne qain<br>saif bin malik, noman ibne umar<br>nafi ibne hilaal, salman ibne mazarib<br>ali bin hur, musab reyahi<br>sawaar ibne umair, umar bin jandab<br>zargaama bin malik, aslam ghulame turki<br>imran bin kaab, qarib bin abdullah<br>muslim bin kasir naeem bin aglan<br>abdullah bin sabeet, umar bin khaalid<br>saeed ibne abdullah, jaabir ibne hajjaz<br>bakar ibne haai, hajjaj bin masruk<br>abdullah bin muslim, mohammad bin muslim<br>jafar ibne aqeel, abdur rahman ibne aqeel<br>habsha bin qais, zahid bin umro<br>sawair ibne umro, nasar bin abi naizar<br>abdullah bin umair, umro bin ansari<br>habab bin aamir, habab bin haaris<br>haaris ibne binhan, jundab ibne hajeer<br>ammar ibne abi salama, munjaeb bin sahem<br>mohammad bin saeed, mohammad bin abdullah<br>aon bin abdullah, qasim ibne hasan<br>mohammad bin hasan, mohammad bin ali<br>abdullah bin ali, imran ibne ali<br>jafar ibne ali, abdullah bin hasan<br>abbas ibne ali, ali asghar<br>ali akbar, maula hussain</big></p> 
